# --- third-party bulk material: fetched, not redistributed (see library/LICENSE_POLICY.md) ---
corpus/raw/
# corpus/ocr is our own OCR of public-domain works: the evidence behind the extraction claims.
# Tracked deliberately (it is small); the bulk scans and IA text dumps stay out.
