!corpus/ocr/INDEX.md
!corpus/ocr/*.ocr.txt
!corpus/ocr/**/
!corpus/ocr/**/*.txt
!corpus/ocr/**/*.meta.json
corpus/ocr/**/*.tif
corpus/ocr/**/*.png
corpus/ocr/**/*.jpg
corpus/scratch/
work/
uploads/
*.pdf
*.pdf.pdf
*.epub
*.epub.*
*.djvu
*.gz
*.zip

